      en: ["At approximately 2,600 meters, it is among Burundi's highest elevations.", "It belongs to the central mountain range of the Nile-Congo divide.", "The summit area features distinct subalpine grassland ecosystems.", "Rare orchid species thrive in the humid, high-altitude climate of the mountain.", "Headwater streams from Mukike feed major rivers in central Burundi.", "The frequent cloud cover facilitates the growth of vital cloud forests."],
